# Core Plugin: Quick Image Viewer

A **Nuclr Commander** quick-view plugin for fast previewing of **BMP**, **JPG**, and **PNG** files.

It uses **Java ImageIO** for simple built-in image loading, so no external native image stack is required.

For broader image format support, use the **ImageMagick Bridge** plugin:
https://github.com/nuclrdev/plugin-imagemagick-bridge

